#* {{quote-book|en|author=Dan Ferullo|chapter=7|title=Monster Hill|location=[Morrisville, N.C.]|publisher=&lbrack;{{w|Lulu.com}}&rbrack;|year=2011|page=298|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=aZBnAwAAQBAJ&pg=PA298|isbn=978-1-257-86763-9|passage=Nordstrom sized up O'Malley's expression, beginning to soften from surly to inquisitive. "We got some info we thought you might be interested in." / "Ya? So what is it? One of those '''fugazis''' from the North End die from a bleeding hemorrhoid 'n Gargiulo wants me to be a pallbearer?"}}
